  "prefLabel": "Plc 907.03 Qualifications for Massage Therapist License Renewal",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 907.03 Qualifications for Massage Therapist License Renewal. Any licensee seeking to renew a massage therapist license shall:\n\n(a) Have obtained the hours of continuing education required by Plc 906.05;\n\n(b) Not have been determined through an adjudicative process of having violated RSA 328-B, Plc 900, or the licensure requirements of any other jurisdiction in which the licensee is currently licensed, or any combination thereof;\n\n(c) Have not answered “yes” to any of the background and character questions in Plc 308.06(e) or have provided an explanation of each “yes” answer pursuant to Plc 304.04 demonstrating that similar circumstances are not likely to arise in New Hampshire; and\n\n(d) Meet the eligibility for renewal criteria specified in Plc 308.02.\n\nSource. #14387, eff 10-17-25, EXPIRES: 10-17-35",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/plc900.html"
